config MONA2_INPUT_PROCESSOR_SPEED_ACCEL
    bool "Speed-dependent cursor scaling for the trackball"
    default y
    depends on DT_HAS_MONA2_INPUT_PROCESSOR_SPEED_ACCEL_ENABLED
    help
      Keyball-style pointer acceleration: the size of each movement
      (|x| + |y|) picks a multiplier from a table, so slow movements are
      slowed down for precise aiming and fast flicks are sped up.
      Built automatically when a "mona2,input-processor-speed-accel"
      node is enabled in the devicetree (right half only).
